{"id":"b3b2004f979e0aad","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-closed-graph.md","title":"Closed Graph Theorem","display":"thm-closed-graph — Closed Graph Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-closed-graph","aliases":["58-thm-closed-graph"],"display":"thm-closed-graph — Closed Graph Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-closed-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-closed-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-closed-graph — Closed Graph Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\">\\(+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\\)</span> (the designated compatible vector-space and norm data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (everywhere-defined linear operator from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\)</span> (Banach-space predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit linear-map predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit bounded-operator predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S\\)</span> (closed-graph predicate for the designated norms, defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> 是下式定义的结构显式接口。</li>\n<li>原五元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S\\)</span> 是相对于本次指定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y\">\\(+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y\\)</span> 的关系；这四个固定背景参数计入下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。其 Assertion 中的兼容式不另量化或重选运算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\)</span> 均表示函数图；新辅助式暂以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_X,\\nu_Y\">\\(\\nu_X,\\nu_Y\\)</span> 标记相同位置的范数参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S(T;X,\\nu_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\nu_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_X,X\\times X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_Y,Y\\times Y,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu_X,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu_Y,Y,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\langle-1,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_X)\n\\land\\{\\langle-1,y\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_X,\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_X),X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_Y,\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_Y),Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to\\nu_X(+_X(\\langle a(n),\\odot_X(\\langle-1,x\\rangle)\\rangle))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to\\nu_Y(+_Y(\\langle T(a(n)),\\odot_Y(\\langle-1,y\\rangle)\\rangle))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to T(x)=y\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S(T;X,\\nu_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\nu_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_X,X\\times X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_Y,Y\\times Y,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu_X,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu_Y,Y,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\langle-1,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_X)\n\\land\\{\\langle-1,y\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_X,\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_X),X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_Y,\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_Y),Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to\\nu_X(+_X(\\langle a(n),\\odot_X(\\langle-1,x\\rangle)\\rangle))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to\\nu_Y(+_Y(\\langle T(a(n)),\\odot_Y(\\langle-1,y\\rangle)\\rangle))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to T(x)=y\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequentially\\text{-}closed\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequentially\\text{-}closed\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed\\text{-}graph}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(Y,\\mathbb F,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed\\text{-}graph}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(Y,\\mathbb F,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closed graph theorem: an everywhere-defined closed linear operator between Banach spaces is bounded.</li>\n<li>The premise and conclusion use the same scalar field, vector operations, and norms; separate existential compatibility aliases could otherwise choose unrelated structures.</li>\n<li>In normed spaces sequential closedness is equivalent to closedness of the graph, so the local predicate avoids an under-specified product-topology witness.</li>\n<li>It is equivalent to the open mapping theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_X,\\nu_Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S(T;X,\\nu_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\nu_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_X,X\\times X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_Y,Y\\times Y,Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu_X,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu_Y,Y,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&\\land\\{\\langle-1,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_X)\n\\land\\{\\langle-1,y\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_X,\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_X),X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_Y,\\operatorname{dom}(\\odot_Y),Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to\\nu_X(+_X(\\langle a(n),\\odot_X(\\langle-1,x\\rangle)\\rangle))<\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to\\nu_Y(+_Y(\\langle T(a(n)),\\odot_Y(\\langle-1,y\\rangle)\\rangle))<\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to T(x)=y\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequentially\\text{-}closed\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraph}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed\\text{-}graph}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(Y,\\mathbb F,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{SequentiallyClosedGraphData}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\\\\n&\\to\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3842,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4075","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-closed-graph.md|58-thm-closed-graph]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["ef59807ad934771f","36d7463d215be751","f67456d74b4